        "message": [
          "%md",
          "",
          "# Safe Cycling in Nuremberg - Spatial AI with OML4Py",
          "",
          "**DOAG 2026 Workshop: \"Spatial AI in Python: Unlocking Machine Learning for Geospatial Intelligence\"**",
          "",
          "Lena works as a mobility planner for the city of Nuremberg. The city wants more people to cycle, but the budget for safer crossings and cycle lanes is limited. Her manager asks: *\"Where do we start?\"*",
          "",
          "In this notebook you help Lena answer five questions with open data and Spatial AI in OML4Py:",
          "",
          "1. **Where do bicycle accidents pile up?** - density clustering with DBSCAN",
          "2. **Is that more than chance?** - hotspot test with Local Moran's I (LISA)",
          "3. **Is there cycling infrastructure nearby?** - proximity analysis",
          "4. **Which schools and kindergartens lie in accident hotspots?** - spatial join",
          "5. **Which places have more bicycle accidents than their traffic and surroundings would explain?** - spatial regression (OLS and GWR)",
          "",
          "All data stays in Oracle Autonomous AI Database. Python runs next to the data, and the results are written back as tables that you can show on a map, for example in Spatial Studio.",
          "",
          "| Part | What you do | Time |",
          "|---|---|---|",
          "| 1 | Set up the notebook | 3 min |",
          "| 2 | Load open data into the database | 7 min |",
          "| 3 | Explore bicycle accidents: types, time and place | 6 min |",
          "| 4 | Find accident clusters (DBSCAN) | 5 min |",
          "| 5 | Test for hotspots (Moran's I, LISA) | 6 min |",
          "| 6 | Check the distance to cycling infrastructure | 4 min |",
          "| 7 | Schools and kindergartens in hotspots | 4 min |",
          "| 8 | More accidents than expected? (OLS, GWR) | 7 min |",
          "| 9 | Save the results for Spatial Studio | 1 min |",
          "",
          "**Data and licences**",
          "* Accidents with personal injury: Unfallatlas, (c) Statistische Aemter des Bundes und der Laender, [Datenlizenz Deutschland - Namensnennung - Version 2.0](https://www.govdata.de/dl-de/by-2-0)",
          "* Residents and age groups in 100 m grid cells: Zensus 2022, (c) Statistische Aemter des Bundes und der Laender, [Datenlizenz Deutschland - Namensnennung - Version 2.0](https://www.govdata.de/dl-de/by-2-0)",
          "* Cycling infrastructure, schools, kindergartens, universities and student housing: (c) [OpenStreetMap contributors](https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright), Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0"
        ],
