      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "",
          "Next you give the columns readable English names, convert codes to numbers and create a point geometry from the UTM coordinates. The column names are the same as in table `ACCIDENTS` from `scripts/sql/01_load_accidents.sql`, so both tables can be used in this notebook."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": true,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "result": null,
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": "Create a GeoDataFrame with readable column names",
        "hasTitle": true,
        "message": [
          "%python",
          "",
          "COLUMNS = {",
          "    'UIDENTSTLAE': 'ACCIDENT_ID',  'UJAHR': 'ACC_YEAR',        'UMONAT': 'ACC_MONTH',",
          "    'USTUNDE': 'ACC_HOUR',         'UWOCHENTAG': 'WEEKDAY',     'AGS': 'AGS',",
          "    'UKATEGORIE': 'CATEGORY',      'UART': 'ACCIDENT_KIND',     'UTYP1': 'ACCIDENT_TYPE',",
          "    'ULICHTVERH': 'LIGHT_CONDITION', 'IstStrassenzustand': 'ROAD_CONDITION',",
          "    'IstRad': 'IS_BICYCLE',        'IstPKW': 'IS_CAR',          'IstFuss': 'IS_PEDESTRIAN',",
          "    'IstKrad': 'IS_MOTORCYCLE',    'IstGkfz': 'IS_GOODS_VEHICLE', 'IstSonstige': 'IS_OTHER',",
          "    'LINREFX': 'X_UTM32',          'LINREFY': 'Y_UTM32',",
          "}",
          "acc = raw.rename(columns=COLUMNS)[list(COLUMNS.values())]",
          "for col in acc.columns.drop(['ACCIDENT_ID', 'AGS']):",
          "    acc[col] = pd.to_numeric(acc[col])",
          "acc.insert(0, 'ID', np.arange(1, len(acc) + 1))",
          "",
          "acc_gdf = gpd.GeoDataFrame(acc, geometry=gpd.points_from_xy(acc['X_UTM32'], acc['Y_UTM32']), crs=CRS_SOURCE)",
          "acc_gdf = acc_gdf.to_crs(CRS_STORE)",
          "acc_gdf['LON'] = acc_gdf.geometry.x.round(7)",
          "acc_gdf['LAT'] = acc_gdf.geometry.y.round(7)",
          "z.show(acc_gdf.head())"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "table",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": false,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "result": null,
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "",
          "###### Expected result",
          "A table with the first five accidents. The first row looks like this (some columns left out):",
          "",
          "```",
          "ID           ACCIDENT_ID  ACC_YEAR  CATEGORY  ACCIDENT_TYPE  IS_BICYCLE  IS_CAR    X_UTM32     Y_UTM32        LON        LAT",
          "--  --------------------  --------  --------  -------------  ----------  ------  ---------  ----------  ---------  ---------",
          " 1  09200101005471014820      2020         3              1           0       1  645064.92  5487508.76  11.004446  49.522823",
          "```",
          "",
          "The codes are now numbers, and every accident has a point geometry. The UTM coordinates (in metres) were converted to longitude/latitude (EPSG:4326) for storage. `X_UTM32` and `Y_UTM32` keep the original metre coordinates."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": true,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
