        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "",
          "###### Expected result",
          "```",
          "Table NUE_ACCIDENTS: 11,002 rows written, spatial index created.",
          "```",
          "`if_exists='replace'` drops and recreates the table, so the paragraph can run again. The spatial index makes spatial queries fast and is needed by Spatial Studio. `del` frees the memory of the intermediate data frames."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": true,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
