          "```",
          "GRID_CELLS  RESIDENTS  UNDER_18  AGE_18_29  AGE_65_PLUS  PCT_CELLS_18_29_SUPPRESSED",
          "----------  ---------  --------  ---------  -----------  --------------------------",
          "     11780     727193    118088     103479       148946                          29",
          "```",
          "",
          "In 29 % of the cells, the number of 18-29-year-olds is suppressed for privacy reasons. Those are cells with very few residents in that age group, so the sum of the age groups is lower than the number of residents. For the model, that is good enough: the cells that matter, with many young residents, are not suppressed."
        ],
