        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "",
          "Finally, the **schools, kindergartens, universities, colleges and student housing** of Nuremberg, extracted from OpenStreetMap as points. You keep the OpenStreetMap ID, the name and the kind of place."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": true,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
