        "message": [
          "%md",
          "",
          "### When do bicycle accidents happen?",
          "",
          "The Unfallatlas records the **year, month, weekday and hour** of every accident, but not the exact date. That is enough to look for patterns over time:",
          "",
          "* **Year to year:** are bicycle accidents becoming more or less frequent, and more or less severe?",
          "* **Season, weekday and hour:** when should Lena expect most accidents?",
          "",
          "Two things to keep in mind:",
          "* **Small numbers:** about 700 bicycle accidents per year means that a change of a few dozen can be chance.",
          "* **Special years:** in 2020 and 2021 the pandemic changed how people travelled: less commuting, but more cycling in leisure time.",
          "",
          "The SQL paragraph uses the analytic function `LAG()` to compare every year with the year before."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": true,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
