          "",
          "###### Expected result",
          "```",
          "Clusters: 18",
          "Accidents in clusters: 277 of 4,387 (6%)",
          "```",
          "Only 6 % of the bicycle accidents belong to a cluster: 18 places where at least 12 accidents happened within 50 m of each other over six years. All other accidents are noise in the sense of DBSCAN: spread over the city, without a dense core."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
