        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "",
          "The largest hotspot region covers the old town and the ring road, where most people cycle. Without data on bicycle traffic you cannot tell whether cycling is *more dangerous* there, only that accidents *concentrate* there. **HIGH-LOW** hexagons are interesting too: single places with many accidents in an otherwise quiet area."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": true,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
