      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "",
          "###### GWR: a separate rule for every place",
          "",
          "**In one sentence:** GWR runs a small OLS regression around every hexagon, so the rule can be different in the old town than on the outskirts.",
          "",
          "**How it works:**",
          "1. For each hexagon, take its 150 nearest hexagons (`KNNWeightsDefinition(k=150)`, about 3.5 km²).",
          "2. Give close hexagons a high weight and distant ones a low weight.",
          "3. Calculate an OLS regression with these weights. The result is a set of numbers a, b and c for this one hexagon.",
          "",
          "If GWR explains clearly more than OLS, and its errors are no longer clustered, the relationship between traffic, young residents and bicycle accidents really differs across the city."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": true,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "result": null,
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": "Train the GWR model and compare it with OLS",
        "hasTitle": true,
        "message": [
          "%python",
          "",
          "gwr = SpatialPipeline([('regression', GWRRegressor(spatial_weights_definition=KNNWeightsDefinition(k=150)))])",
          "gwr.fit(reg_sdf, 'BIKE_ACC')",
          "grid['EXPECTED_GWR'] = gwr.predict(reg_sdf.drop(['BIKE_ACC'])).flatten()",
          "grid['ERROR_GWR']    = grid['BIKE_ACC'] - grid['EXPECTED_GWR']",
          "",
          "moran_gwr = MoranITest.create(SpatialDataFrame.create(GeoDataFrameDataset(grid[['ERROR_GWR', 'geometry']])),",
          "                              knn6, column_name='ERROR_GWR')",
          "print(f\"OLS: R2 = {metrics.r2_score(grid['BIKE_ACC'], grid['EXPECTED_OLS']):.2f}   Moran's I of the errors = {moran_ols.i:.2f}\")",
          "print(f\"GWR: R2 = {metrics.r2_score(grid['BIKE_ACC'], grid['EXPECTED_GWR']):.2f}   Moran's I of the errors = {moran_gwr.i:.2f}\")"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "raw",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": false,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
