          "OLS: R2 = 0.58   Moran's I of the errors = 0.19",
          "GWR: R2 = 0.71   Moran's I of the errors = 0.01",
          "```",
          "With a separate rule for every neighbourhood, the model explains about 71 % instead of 58 %, and the errors are no longer clustered. The GWR values can differ slightly, because they depend on how the neighbours are weighted. Training takes a few seconds, because GWR calculates one regression for each of the 2,646 hexagons."
        ],
