          "```",
          "Table                       Content",
          "--------------------------  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------",
          "NUE_BIKE_ACCIDENT_CLUSTERS  every bicycle accident with its cluster (-1 = noise) and the distance to the nearest cycling way",
          "NUE_HOTSPOT_GRID            hexagons with the number of bicycle accidents, the LISA label, the explanatory variables and the expected number of accidents (EXPECTED_OLS, EXCESS, EXPECTED_GWR)",
          "NUE_CLUSTER_SUMMARY         one point per cluster with its rank and key figures",
